    "prerequisite_map": {
      "modules": [
        "Modules 1–3 build API, web, and REST foundations; Module 2 should precede detailed HTTP method/status work.",
        "Module 4 resource modeling precedes Module 8 CRUD implementation.",
        "Modules 8–12 introduce implementation, validation, architecture, and persistence before identity/security projects.",
        "Modules 13–14 establish identity and authorization before security assessment work.",
        "Modules 15–16 establish contracts and tests before contract governance and production release gates.",
        "Modules 17–18 introduce caching, concurrency, jobs, webhooks, and integrations before distributed architecture work.",
        "Modules 19–21 cover compatibility, resilience, deployment, observability, and recovery; Modules 22–24 apply these in professional design."
      ],
